                <mxCell id="layer6_label" value="PROJECT FILE STRUCTURE (Developer Reference)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;fontColor=#6B6B80;fontSize=10;fontWeight=bold;strokeColor=none;align=left;letterSpacing=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="30" y="1058" width="400" height="16" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fs_tree" value="sanctum-bot/&#xa;├── config.js              # All config + env vars&#xa;├── start.js               # Entry: migration + boot&#xa;├── ecosystem.config.js    # PM2 processes&#xa;├── src/&#xa;│   ├── index.js           # Startup orchestration&#xa;│   ├── bot.js              # Discord client class&#xa;│   ├── commands/           # 10 categories, ~20 files&#xa;│   ├── database/           # connection.js + schema.js&#xa;│   ├── events/             # ready, messageCreate, interactionCreate&#xa;│   ├── handlers/           # command, event, error handlers&#xa;│   ├── structures/         # Command base + models&#xa;│   └── utils/              # embed, functions, logger, permissions&#xa;├── dashboard/              # Production dashboard&#xa;│   ├── server.js&#xa;│   ├── views/ (24 modules)&#xa;│   └── public/&#xa;├── dashboard-standalone/   # Dev dashboard (no bot)&#xa;├── assets/&#xa;└── .env" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;fontColor=#9D9DB5;fontSize=9;align=left;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=monospace;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="1078" width="760" height="92" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="arch_notes" value="ARCHITECTURE NOTES&#xa;‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾&#xa;• bot.js extends Client with 17 Gateway Intents + 6 Partials&#xa;• Commands extend base Command class with prefix + slash dual dispatch&#xa;• Dashboard shares in-memory bot instance via require()&#xa;• All module toggles read from config.js at startup&#xa;• DB pool created once, shared across bot + dashboard via mysql2/promise&#xa;• Lavalink connects via WebSocket for audio (planned replacement for ytdl)&#xa;• PM2 manages two processes: bot + dashboard&#xa;• Standalone dashboard mocks data for frontend-only development&#xa;• Every dashboard module page has real config form fields (not just display)" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;fontColor=#9D9DB5;fontSize=10;align=left;strokeColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="860" y="1078" width="700" height="95" as="geometry"/>
